# Root .gitignore for the anki-card-generator monorepo.
# Each subproject (anki-card-manager-android/, anki-card-manager-proxy/) also
# has its own .gitignore, which git still applies within that folder. The rules
# here are defensive, cross-cutting, and belt-and-suspenders for anything that
# must never reach a public repo.

# --- Secrets & credentials (never commit) ---
**/local.properties
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
**/*.p12
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/service-account*.json
**/gcp-*.json
**/google-services.json

# --- Build output ---
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/.kotlin/
**/node_modules/
**/.vercel

# --- IDE / tooling ---
.idea/
**/.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
**/.claude/
.gradle/

# --- Logs & crash dumps ---
*.log
**/*.log
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log

# --- OS cruft ---
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
